 bon soir! [left ear] En attendan the John Giorno baaaaaaaand [echo: baaaand][right ear].","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Alan Lord","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13#t=1699,1712"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Applause.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Audience","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13#t=1712,1714"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Pendent que les techniciens vont defiler le renfilage et vice versa [echo], on va visioner le film de Napoleon Moffat qui s’appelle Framed-d. Qui est originalement un super huite qui a ete transfer a trois–three quarter inch, trois quarts video. C’est un film excellent pis un des meilleures… Pour cinq minutes vous avez le poesie visuel plein de geule, okay? [left ear bias, right ear echo].","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Alan Lord","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13#t=1712,1742"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Chatter, soft clapping.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Audience","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13#t=1742,1797"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Napoleon Moffat’s \"Framed\" starts [piano music].","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Napoleon Moffat","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Music","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13#t=1797,1834"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Film continues [speech: There are spaces that live within us. Spaces which occupy the frame. The transparency of their names. A terrible tragedy that haunts their walls. The revelation of their fiction. Of something which might of happened but that never really occurred].","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Napoleon Moffat","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Unknown Performer","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Music","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13#t=1834,1861"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Film continues [piano music].","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Napoleon Moffat","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Music","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13#t=1861,1906"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"[End of recording].","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"END","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13#t=1906,1906"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Room noise.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Foufounes Electriques","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13#t=200,204"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Room noise.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Foufounes Electriques","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13#t=414,426"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Fades out sound piece, sound quality more distant.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Jean-Paul Curtay","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Recorded Sound","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13#t=1685,1692"}]},{"@context":"http://iiif.io/api/presentation/3/context.json","id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/manifests/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05-canvas13-1","type":"AnnotationPage","label":{"en":["Alan Lord Commentary"]},"items":[{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Jean-Paul Curtay is a French visual artist, writer, video artist, poet, and Lettrist choreographer born in 1951. He is the inventor of “bodily music” and “hypergraphic music.” In painting, his primary mode of expression is hypergraphy (the use of the sign as the sole represented object).","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Biographical Context","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13#t=0,0"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"He is the author of the first anthology of Lettrist poetry, which he published in 1974. One of his pastels is part of the collection","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Biographical Context","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13#t=95,95"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Very active in the Lettrist scene beginning in 1967, he began to distance himself from the group around 1978. He ceased all public creative activity in 1988. Jean-Paul Curtay is also known as a physician specializing in nutritional therapy and herbal medicine.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Biographical Context","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13#t=174,174"}]}],"items":[{"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05-canvas13/paintings","type":"AnnotationPage","items":[{"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05-canvas13/paintings","type":"Annotation","motivation":"painting","body":{"id":"https://youtu.be/BcQC1kwzvfk","type":"Sound","format":"unknown","duration":1906},"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/jean_paul_curtay_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/13"}]}]}]}